{"logId": "f9940775-9b5d-4258-89c8-d3062c0f623c", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——休假", "block_bbox": [166, 140, 455, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 140.0], [455.0, 140.0], [455.0, 173.0], [166.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [165, 213, 301, 237], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 213.0], [301.0, 213.0], [301.0, 237.0], [165.0, 237.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、休假期间不允许接打电话处理工作事项", "block_bbox": [181, 253, 523, 277], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 253.0], [523.0, 253.0], [523.0, 277.0], [181.0, 277.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）不允许主动给休假人员拨打工作电话（除特殊的重大事故）", "block_bbox": [192, 284, 691, 309], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 284.0], [691.0, 284.0], [691.0, 309.0], [192.0, 309.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）休假人员不允许打电话处理工作事项（除特殊的重大事故）", "block_bbox": [192, 314, 691, 339], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 314.0], [691.0, 314.0], [691.0, 339.0], [192.0, 339.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不信任自己的团队或同事，将工作交由其他部门或其他人代管或监管", "block_bbox": [182, 345, 754, 369], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 345.0], [754.0, 345.0], [754.0, 369.0], [182.0, 369.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、以“没有钱”“走不开”“家有孩子”等为理由，拒绝享受休假", "block_bbox": [182, 376, 721, 400], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 376.0], [721.0, 376.0], [721.0, 400.0], [182.0, 400.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、利用休假时间打临时工、做兼职等", "block_bbox": [182, 407, 487, 430], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 407.0], [487.0, 407.0], [487.0, 430.0], [182.0, 430.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、选择低价格、服务和品质差的旅行团", "block_bbox": [182, 437, 504, 461], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 437.0], [504.0, 437.0], [504.0, 461.0], [182.0, 461.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、缺乏安全防护意识及自我保护意识，被盗、被骗、被强制消费等", "block_bbox": [182, 468, 719, 492], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 468.0], [719.0, 468.0], [719.0, 492.0], [182.0, 492.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、盲目跟风、打卡、超出能力范围的过度消费等行为", "block_bbox": [182, 498, 614, 522], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 498.0], [614.0, 498.0], [614.0, 522.0], [182.0, 522.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、有不文明现象（乱涂乱画、语言粗狂、破坏花草树木、乱扔垃圾等）", "block_bbox": [182, 529, 743, 553], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 529.0], [743.0, 529.0], [743.0, 553.0], [182.0, 553.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、休闲娱乐必须保证健康、安全，禁止集体组织或涉及黄赌毒等活动", "block_bbox": [181, 560, 739, 584], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[187.0, 560.0], [738.0, 560.0], [738.0, 583.0], [187.0, 583.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、休假过程中，与同行伙伴产生争执、不愉快等影响休假品质的行为", "block_bbox": [182, 590, 748, 615], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 590.0], [748.0, 590.0], [748.0, 615.0], [182.0, 615.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "11、恶意劝酒、酒后寻衅滋事等，引起纠纷或对自己、他人身心造成伤害等严重后果", "block_bbox": [182, 621, 854, 646], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 621.0], [854.0, 621.0], [854.0, 646.0], [182.0, 646.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[88]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 611, 738], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——休假", "block_bbox": [203, 900, 493, 932], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 900.0], [493.0, 900.0], [493.0, 932.0], [203.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：净心自由地投入休假，非常轻松悠闲地享受休假。", "block_bbox": [201, 975, 749, 1001], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 975.0], [749.0, 975.0], [749.0, 1001.0], [201.0, 1001.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：能够非常净心地投入休假，自由随性地享受休假时光，任意选择喜欢的方式，让自己的身心得到充分的放松！", "block_bbox": [201, 1021, 1048, 1077], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 1021.0], [1048.0, 1021.0], [1048.0, 1077.0], [201.0, 1077.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1119, 320, 1144], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1119.0], [320.0, 1119.0], [320.0, 1144.0], [202.0, 1144.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、有良好的休假理念认知，理解休假的意义和价值", "block_bbox": [218, 1159, 631, 1184], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1159.0], [631.0, 1159.0], [631.0, 1184.0], [218.0, 1184.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、从特定的工作和生活圈中脱离出来，能够净心地、没有包袱地投入休假", "block_bbox": [218, 1189, 808, 1215], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1189.0], [808.0, 1189.0], [808.0, 1215.0], [218.0, 1215.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、选择任何让自己放松的方式，该吃吃、该睡睡，只要自己喜欢就可以", "block_bbox": [217, 1220, 793, 1245], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[223.0, 1220.0], [792.0, 1220.0], [792.0, 1244.0], [223.0, 1244.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、非常自由、随性的状态，感觉到精神的悠闲和愉悦", "block_bbox": [218, 1252, 650, 1276], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1252.0], [650.0, 1252.0], [650.0, 1276.0], [218.0, 1276.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、感觉生命充满了健康和活力", "block_bbox": [220, 1282, 470, 1306], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1282.0], [470.0, 1282.0], [470.0, 1306.0], [220.0, 1306.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[89]", "block_bbox": [611, 1476, 649, 1498], "block_id": 25, "block_order": null, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1476.0], [648.0, 1476.0], [648.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7979898452758789, "coordinate": [166, 140, 455, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 140.0], [455.0, 140.0], [455.0, 173.0], [166.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7144207954406738, "coordinate": [165, 213, 301, 237], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 213.0], [301.0, 213.0], [301.0, 237.0], [165.0, 237.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7703577876091003, "coordinate": [181, 253, 523, 277], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[181.0, 253.0], [523.0, 253.0], [523.0, 277.0], [181.0, 277.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7734073400497437, "coordinate": [192, 284, 691, 309], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[192.0, 284.0], [691.0, 284.0], [691.0, 309.0], [192.0, 309.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.769959568977356, "coordinate": [192, 314, 691, 339], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[192.0, 314.0], [691.0, 314.0], [691.0, 339.0], [192.0, 339.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7751322388648987, "coordinate": [182, 345, 754, 369], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 345.0], [754.0, 345.0], [754.0, 369.0], [182.0, 369.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7792852520942688, "coordinate": [182, 376, 721, 400], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 376.0], [721.0, 376.0], [721.0, 400.0], [182.0, 400.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7582417726516724, "coordinate": [182, 407, 487, 430], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 407.0], [487.0, 407.0], [487.0, 430.0], [182.0, 430.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7735894918441772, "coordinate": [182, 437, 504, 461], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 437.0], [504.0, 437.0], [504.0, 461.0], [182.0, 461.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7942508459091187, "coordinate": [182, 468, 719, 492], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 468.0], [719.0, 468.0], [719.0, 492.0], [182.0, 492.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7868398427963257, "coordinate": [182, 498, 614, 522], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 498.0], [614.0, 498.0], [614.0, 522.0], [182.0, 522.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8002223968505859, "coordinate": [182, 529, 743, 553], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 529.0], [743.0, 529.0], [743.0, 553.0], [182.0, 553.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.80020672082901, "coordinate": [181, 560, 739, 584], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[187.0, 560.0], [738.0, 560.0], [738.0, 583.0], [187.0, 583.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8075960278511047, "coordinate": [182, 590, 748, 615], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 590.0], [748.0, 590.0], [748.0, 615.0], [182.0, 615.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8050159215927124, "coordinate": [182, 621, 854, 646], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 621.0], [854.0, 621.0], [854.0, 646.0], [182.0, 646.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6199967265129089, "coordinate": [573, 716, 611, 738], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8722308874130249, "coordinate": [203, 900, 493, 932], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[203.0, 900.0], [493.0, 900.0], [493.0, 932.0], [203.0, 932.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.612583577632904, "coordinate": [201, 975, 749, 1001], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 975.0], [749.0, 975.0], [749.0, 1001.0], [201.0, 1001.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8963994383811951, "coordinate": [201, 1021, 1048, 1077], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 1021.0], [1048.0, 1021.0], [1048.0, 1077.0], [201.0, 1077.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6790584921836853, "coordinate": [202, 1119, 320, 1144], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 1119.0], [320.0, 1119.0], [320.0, 1144.0], [202.0, 1144.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8093022704124451, "coordinate": [218, 1159, 631, 1184], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1159.0], [631.0, 1159.0], [631.0, 1184.0], [218.0, 1184.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8052636981010437, "coordinate": [218, 1189, 808, 1215], "order": 22, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1189.0], [808.0, 1189.0], [808.0, 1215.0], [218.0, 1215.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8009176254272461, "coordinate": [217, 1220, 793, 1245], "order": 23, "polygon_points": [[223.0, 1220.0], [792.0, 1220.0], [792.0, 1244.0], [223.0, 1244.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7808371186256409, "coordinate": [218, 1252, 650, 1276], "order": 24, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1252.0], [650.0, 1252.0], [650.0, 1276.0], [218.0, 1276.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7663595080375671, "coordinate": [220, 1282, 470, 1306], "order": 25, "polygon_points": [[220.0, 1282.0], [470.0, 1282.0], [470.0, 1306.0], [220.0, 1306.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.5825138688087463, "coordinate": [611, 1476, 649, 1498], "order": 26, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1476.0], [648.0, 1476.0], [648.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——休假\n\n## - 不符合的行为：\n\n1、休假期间不允许接打电话处理工作事项\n\n（1）不允许主动给休假人员拨打工作电话（除特殊的重大事故）\n\n（2）休假人员不允许打电话处理工作事项（除特殊的重大事故）\n\n2、不信任自己的团队或同事，将工作交由其他部门或其他人代管或监管\n\n3、以“没有钱”“走不开”“家有孩子”等为理由，拒绝享受休假\n\n4、利用休假时间打临时工、做兼职等\n\n5、选择低价格、服务和品质差的旅行团\n\n6、缺乏安全防护意识及自我保护意识，被盗、被骗、被强制消费等\n\n7、盲目跟风、打卡、超出能力范围的过度消费等行为\n\n8、有不文明现象（乱涂乱画、语言粗狂、破坏花草树木、乱扔垃圾等）\n\n9、休闲娱乐必须保证健康、安全，禁止集体组织或涉及黄赌毒等活动\n\n10、休假过程中，与同行伙伴产生争执、不愉快等影响休假品质的行为\n\n11、恶意劝酒、酒后寻衅滋事等，引起纠纷或对自己、他人身心造成伤害等严重后果\n\n[88]\n\n## 考评奖励标准——休假\n\n## 二 级【1~2分】：净心自由地投入休假，非常轻松悠闲地享受休假。\n\n- 本条释义：能够非常净心地投入休假，自由随性地享受休假时光，任意选择喜欢的方式，让自己的身心得到充分的放松！\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、有良好的休假理念认知，理解休假的意义和价值\n\n2、从特定的工作和生活圈中脱离出来，能够净心地、没有包袱地投入休假\n\n3、选择任何让自己放松的方式，该吃吃、该睡睡，只要自己喜欢就可以\n\n4、非常自由、随性的状态，感觉到精神的悠闲和愉悦\n\n5、感觉生命充满了健康和活力", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f9940775-9b5d-4258-89c8-d3062c0f623c/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe85132de9a20b48f0ec3664db2a6f10113210ffa369f0fdbb27041692b7b63d2"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f9940775-9b5d-4258-89c8-d3062c0f623c/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2Fea48f632ff4d71bdca9d6048bca883128ac1b57072d222c0f6034f7da1a0b3e7"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f9940775-9b5d-4258-89c8-d3062c0f623c/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F6bfabe7af690ce4fc5c2fb988a1cb16a9fc580f31e117e7661be156ad8eb9a00"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
